Rename this file to V1__enable_pgvector.sql and replace this text with the SQL.

It is not a .sql file yet on purpose: Flyway only picks up *.sql files. If an
empty placeholder V1 ran, Flyway would record its checksum, and every database
that ran it would fail validation once you wrote the real V1.
